@startuml breadpan-menu
participant 消费方
participant breadpan
participant "Item（dbusmenu）" as item

消费方 -> breadpan: 入口
note right of breadpan
  right_click / left_click(menu_only) 路由命中（§3.6）；
  或 menu() / menu_expand()
  （弹窗打开期间 MenuChanged 重取）
end note
breadpan -> item: AboutToShow(parent)
note right of item
  常规前置：触发 Item 惰性构建 / 刷新
end note
item --> breadpan: 需要更新?
breadpan -> item: GetLayout(parent, 1 层)
breadpan -> item: GetGroupProperties
item --> breadpan: 布局 + 属性
breadpan -> breadpan: 组装该层快照
breadpan --> 消费方: InteractionOutcome::Menu
@enduml
